# Scratch / regeneratable analysis output
work/
*.json.bak

# Per-title scratch: the lifted C, the build, the logs and the screenshots.
# All of it regenerates from the binary, and the biggest of them is a quarter
# of a million lines.
titles/*/gen/
titles/*/work/

# Extracted assets (regenerate from your own copy)
extracted/

# --- Original retail game files: NOT redistributed in this repo ---
# Every game here is (c) The Learning Company, 1992-1996. Long out of print, but
# copyright most likely still subsists (the TLC -> SoftKey -> Mattel ->
# Riverdeep -> HMH chain). Keep ALL original binaries and assets local-only.
# Bring your own CD and drop its contents into original/ yourself.
titles/*/original/
original/
*.EXE
*.DLL
*.RSC
*.GRP
*.MPS
*.SMK
*.MID
*.WAV
*.CAB
*.DAT
*.ISO
*.iso
*.Z

# The linker map is a shipped original file too (this disc ships none)
*.MAP

# OS
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
